cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "CDISC Safety Dashboard: raw clinical trial data to SDTM, ADaM and safety analytics"
abstract: "An end-to-end, fault-tolerant clinical trial safety pipeline and interactive dashboard. It converts raw EDC-style demographics, adverse-event and laboratory data into CDISC SDTM (DM, AE, LB) and ADaM (ADSL, ADAE, ADLB) datasets, applies data-quality and conformance rules with quarantine and audit trails, exports SAS XPT v5 transport files, and produces safety tables including treatment-emergent adverse event summaries, risk differences with Newcombe confidence intervals, laboratory shift tables and an eDISH Hy's law screen."
authors:
